Backport of CVE-2026-40476 / GHSA-68jq-c3rv-pcrr DoS fix from
webonyx/graphql-php v15.31.5 (upstream commit b5e7c995b6) to
the v14.x line. The fix is purely additive: it deduplicates
structurally identical repeated fields before the quadratic
pairwise conflict comparison, reducing O(n²) to O(u²) where u
is the number of unique field signatures. On v15.x the helper
methods had return type declarations; we omit those here to
match v14.x's private-method conventions.

